msgctxt "3912"
msgid "So, Kiryu-san. Do you come to cabaret clubs often?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3924"
msgid "You could say that."
msgstr "Diciamo così."

msgctxt "3936"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "3948"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "3960"
msgid "Well, I gotta admit, I don't know much about them myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "3984"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3996"
msgid "What do men even like about them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4008"
msgid "...Well, we enjoy the conversation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid "Hmm. Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4032"
msgid "Is this your part-time job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4044"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Sì..."

msgctxt "4056"
msgid "Well, I'm a college student. I'll be graduating soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4068"
msgid "Have you decided on a career?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4080"
msgid "Totally."
msgstr "Proprio così."

msgctxt "4092"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "4104"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4116"
msgid "...And what is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4128"
msgid "Fashion design."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4140"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "4152"
msgid ""
"I mean, keeping up \"working relationships\" would be super annoying, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4164"
msgid "I wouldn't last a day in some stuffy office."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4188"
msgid "Congratulations on finishing college."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4200"
msgid "Yeah... Thank you."
msgstr "Sì... Grazie."

msgctxt "4212"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4224"
msgid "...Guess you're a member of society now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4236"
msgid "Guess so."
msgstr "Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "4248"
msgid "Honestly, I am so over school by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4260"
msgid "College and classes were sooo boring..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4272"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284"
msgid "Why take this kind of job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4296"
msgid "Huh!? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "4308"
msgid "You don't have to answer if you don't want to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4320"
msgid "...Well, same as anyone else. I need the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4344"
msgid "How about you, Kiryu-san? What do you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4356"
msgid "You mean, as a job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4368"
msgid "Yeah. I'm kinda curious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380"
msgid "I don't really hang out with guys like you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4392"
msgid "I can tell you don't have a normal job. Just look at your clothes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4404"
msgid "You're kinda like... oh, you know what I mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4416"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "4428"
msgid "Oh! A thug?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4440"
msgid "But you don't look like one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4452"
msgid "\"Thug\" isn't too far off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4464"
msgid "What!? Seriously?"
msgstr "Cosa!? Sul serio!?"

msgctxt "4476"
msgid "I dunno... That doesn't exactly fit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4488"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "La pensi così?"

msgctxt "4500"
msgid "You're more than some punk..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4512"
msgid "If I had to guess, you're probably a bigshot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4536"
msgid "I'm a civil servant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4548"
msgid "Whoa! Are you serious? You're some fancy bigwig?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4560"
msgid "Don't believe everything you hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "4584"
msgid "If that was a joke, Kiryu-san, I don't get your sense of humor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4596"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."

msgctxt "4608"
msgid "I'm an enterpreneur."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4620"
msgid "Ohhh, I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4632"
msgid "Oh! So you're, like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4644"
msgid "...like me! You're in the nightlife business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4656"
msgid "You could say that."
msgstr "Diciamo così."

msgctxt "4668"
msgid "What!? So what's it like? Gimme details!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4680"
msgid "I'm not exactly proud of my work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4692"
msgid "Aww, come on! You can tell me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4704"
msgid "You'll work it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4716"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you have a wife?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4728"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "4740"
msgid "How about a girlfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4752"
msgid "Who's asking?"
msgstr "Chi lo vuole sapere?"

msgctxt "4764"
msgid "Heheheh. You're such a tease! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4776"
msgid "How about you?"
msgstr "E tu?"

msgctxt "4788"
msgid "I've got a boyfriend. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4800"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4812"
msgid "We live together. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4824"
msgid "Under one roof, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4836"
msgid "Yes! ♪ We're probably getting married."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4860"
msgid "I can't wait until we're husband and wife! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872"
msgid "I'll bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4884"
msgid ""
"I'll get up early and make breakfast, see my honey off to work, then go back"
" to sleep..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4896"
msgid ""
"Then I'll wake up for the noontime dramas, do laundry, eat snacks, tidy "
"up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4908"
msgid "Heheheh. And I'll fit an afternoon nap in there, too. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4920"
msgid "That's a lot of sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4932"
msgid ""
"Then it'll eventually be evening, and I'll remember I wanted to go shopping,"
" but I'll just take another nap..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4944"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4956"
msgid ""
"Then, my husband will come home, and he'll see what a mess I am, and get mad"
" at me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4968"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. It's my dream to laze around all day like that. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4980"
msgid "Isn't that unhealthy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4992"
msgid "You think?"
msgstr "Dici?"

msgctxt "5004"
msgid "But doing what you want is good for your mental health, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5016"
msgid "So that means doing stuff you hate is actually super unhealthy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5028"
msgid "I guess you have a point."
msgstr "Immagino tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "5040"
msgid ""
"I'll do what I want, when I want... and then I'll kick back and relax! "
"Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5052"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5064"
msgid "And right now, I want to go home early! Is it cool if I bounce?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5076"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Ehi."

msgctxt "5088"
msgid "I would never have guessed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5100"
msgid "Yeah, you're not the only one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5112"
msgid "Everyone says I seem like more of a party girl than a homebody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5124"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "5136"
msgid "Well, whatever. I'm used to people getting the wrong idea about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5160"
msgid "Now I just want to go home early! Is it cool if I bounce?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5172"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Ehi."

msgctxt "5184"
msgid "All you want to do is sit around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5196"
msgid "Hehehe, maybe I do. I'd love that! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5208"
msgid "I feel sorry for your future husband..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5220"
msgid "Hey, it's not set in stone yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5232"
msgid "Seriously, I was just exaggerating earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5244"
msgid "If I really got married, I'd be a proper wife! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5268"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you ever peek at your girlfriend's texts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5280"
msgid "Never."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5292"
msgid "What, really?"
msgstr "Wow, davvero?"

msgctxt "5304"
msgid "Really."
msgstr "Davvero."

msgctxt "5316"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "5328"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "5340"
msgid ""
"One of my friends is in trouble. Her boyfriend found something on her "
"phone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5352"
msgid "And now it sounds like they're gonna break up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5364"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "5376"
msgid "Isn't it totally crazy for men to look through their partners' phones?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5388"
msgid "It's an invasion of privacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400"
msgid "I know, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5412"
msgid "What kind of loser reads his girlfriend's texts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5424"
msgid "No kidding."
msgstr "Dici sul serio?"

msgctxt "5436"
msgid "Seriously, it's a total creep move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5448"
msgid ""
"Though... I have to say, Kiryu-san, it's nice to see you're not that kind of"
" guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5460"
msgid "Heheheh."
msgstr "Eheheh."

msgctxt "5472"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5484"
msgid "What's wrong with it?"
msgstr "Che c'è di male?"

msgctxt "5496"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cosa...?"

msgctxt "5508"
msgid ""
"I mean, sometimes a girl has to see what her man's up to, but isn't it "
"creepy when the guy does it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5520"
msgid "...So it's fine if a woman does it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5532"
msgid "What, like that's weird?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5544"
msgid "Well, maybe a little..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5556"
msgid "Wouldn't you look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5568"
msgid "Huh!? Me?"
msgstr "Eh!? Io?"

msgctxt "5580"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "5592"
msgid "I don't do that..."
msgstr "Non è roba mia."

msgctxt "5604"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "5616"
msgid "I think if I did, it'd just stir up a ton of drama. Hehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5640"
msgid "What's wrong with doing separate things while we're together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5652"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "5664"
msgid ""
"I was talking to a friend today, and when I told her how me and my boyfriend"
" hang out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5676"
msgid "She called me a weirdo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5688"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5700"
msgid "Like, look. I read a lot of books."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5712"
msgid "But while I'm reading, my boyfriend's free to watch TV and stuff. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5724"
msgid "What's wrong with doing separate things while living together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5736"
msgid "That makes sense, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5748"
msgid ""
"I'd feel bad for tying down my boyfriend, and I don't wanna get tied down "
"myself. But it's still nice being together, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5760"
msgid "Sounds kind of distant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5772"
msgid "Huh? But we're right next to each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5784"
msgid "But you're not talking to him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5796"
msgid "I mean, that's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5808"
msgid ""
"But I think it's like how a lot of older couples are. Even when they're not "
"talking, there's still a connection there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5820"
msgid "...Is that really what it's like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5832"
msgid "It's nice to have time to yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5844"
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr "Perché dici così?"

msgctxt "5856"
msgid ""
"If you're always together, you might start taking each other for granted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5868"
msgid ""
"Huh. I dunno. I'd just wonder if we really liked each other, at that point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880"
msgid ""
"I think if you really love someone, you'd be happy to be together forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5904"
msgid "I couldn't take that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5916"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Perché no?"

msgctxt "5928"
msgid "If the tension built up too much, I'd eventually pounce..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5940"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5952"
msgid ""
"I mean, you have a point... That does happen whenever we start flirting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5964"
msgid ""
"Honestly, Kiryu-san, I could see it! You could probably turn into a real "
"animal out of nowhere... <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5976"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5988"
msgid "I'm at war with my boyfriend right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6000"
msgid "You two have a fight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6012"
msgid "I wish he'd just calm down and forgive me already..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6024"
msgid "He's the one mad at you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6036"
msgid "And he won't let go! Ugh, fights are so annoying..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6048"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "6060"
msgid "I mean, who gets that mad over putting cherry tomatoes in miso soup?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6072"
msgid "You put... tomatoes in miso soup?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6084"
msgid "See, the soup was cooking, and I was making salad on the side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6096"
msgid "It was totally an accident! I just dropped a few tomatoes in the pot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6120"
msgid ""
"When I looked in the pot, those red cherry tomatoes had turned the miso soup"
" from brown to pink! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6132"
msgid "Heheheh. Kinda funny, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6144"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "6156"
msgid "I was worried it was gonna taste terrible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168"
msgid ""
"But it actually turned out to be not that bad! So I gave my boyfriend a "
"bowl, and you know what he did?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6180"
msgid ""
"Yelled at me! \"Why the hell did you put tomatoes in my soup!?\" Can you "
"believe him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6192"
msgid "I told him it was an accident! It's whatever, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6204"
msgid "You can just take them out yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6216"
msgid "Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6228"
msgid ""
"Besides, the soup was good! Apart from the tomatoes, I mean. But when I said"
" that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6240"
msgid "He totally lost it."
msgstr "Ha perso completamente la testa!"

msgctxt "6252"
msgid "Well, no wonder he'd be angry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6264"
msgid "Seriously? It's a pain in the butt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6276"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "La pensi così?"

msgctxt "6288"
msgid "I'm so tired of him getting worked up over every little thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6300"
msgid "Men are such delicate snowflakes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6312"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6324"
msgid "Besides, isn't it kind of a funny image? All those floating tomatoes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6336"
msgid "Uh... sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6348"
msgid "That does sound like it could work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6360"
msgid "I know, right!? Isn't it, like, weirdly comforting? Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6372"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "Forse."

msgctxt "6384"
msgid "You totally get what I mean, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6396"
msgid "Still, I don't know if it'd actually taste good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6408"
msgid "Hehehe! ♪ Details, details!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6420"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "6432"
msgid "I'd like to try some of this miso soup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6444"
msgid "Hehehe. You don't have to lie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6456"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "6468"
msgid "You'd seriously eat tomatoes in miso soup? That sounds super gross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6480"
msgid "You're the one who served it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6492"
msgid "Yeah, so? I thought it would be funny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6504"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "6516"
msgid "Heheheh..."
msgstr "Ehehe..."

msgctxt "6528"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "6540"
msgid "My teacher sent me a picture! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6552"
msgid "Your teacher?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6564"
msgid ""
"One of my old college professors, I mean. He's wearing a hat I knitted "
"myself. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6576"
msgid "So he sent me a photo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6588"
msgid "What's the story behind that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6600"
msgid "Last winter, I was wearing this knitted purple hat..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612"
msgid ""
"And this old guy at my school kept staring. He was really into that hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6624"
msgid "Eventually I was like \"What?\" And my professor, like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6636"
msgid "Well, he just came right out with it, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6648"
msgid "What'd he say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6660"
msgid "He said he wanted my purple hat! He just flat-out asked me for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6672"
msgid ""
"He seriously had me cracking up! His hair was totally going gray, too. ♪ "
"Hehehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6684"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "6696"
msgid ""
"The thought of him in the hat was just too funny. I had to give it to him. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6708"
msgid ""
"Since then, he's been wearing it. And every once in a while, he sends me "
"pics of him rocking my style!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6720"
msgid "How about a gift for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6732"
msgid "Huh!? Like what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6744"
msgid "Anything's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6756"
msgid "...But why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6768"
msgid "No reason, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6780"
msgid "Seriously, what? I don't get you, man..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6792"
msgid "Well, never mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6804"
msgid "You're pretty fond of him, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6816"
msgid "Hehehe! I guess I am! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6828"
msgid ""
"I get such a kick out of how excited he is. He's just a guy who loves his "
"hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6840"
msgid "That's great."
msgstr "Fantastico."

msgctxt "6852"
msgid "Sounds like a funny guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6864"
msgid "He is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6876"
msgid ""
"We sorta ended up friends after that. He still messages me sometimes. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6888"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "6900"
msgid "We never talk about school, though. Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6912"
msgid "So you'll get a picture next year, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6924"
msgid "Probably!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6936"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "6948"
msgid "I should get a driver's license..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6960"
msgid "You don't have one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6972"
msgid "Nope..."
msgstr "No..."

msgctxt "6984"
msgid "It's just a pain to go take lessons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6996"
msgid "You'll need a license if you want to drive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7008"
msgid ""
"I don't like taking the train, and I'd like to be able to pick him up and "
"drop him off, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7020"
msgid "...Actually, my boyfriend said something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7032"
msgid ""
"According to him, I should learn to take the train before I learn to drive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7044"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "7056"
msgid "But then he got personal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7068"
msgid ""
"All this stuff about how I piss guys off, so if I get my professor mad, I'll"
" never graduate..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7080"
msgid "Damn."
msgstr "Dannazione."

msgctxt "7092"
msgid "...I mean, him saying that doesn't make it true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7104"
msgid ""
"I get that I should learn to take the train, but what's this crap about "
"pissing men off!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7116"
msgid "What kind of guy says that stuff? To his own girlfriend, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7128"
msgid "It doesn't seem like you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7140"
msgid "Do what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7152"
msgid "I mean, about making guys angry. You don't seem like the type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7176"
msgid "Even if I do make guys mad, it's not like I care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7188"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "7200"
msgid ""
"The only reason I'm pissed off is 'cause I don't know why he gets so pissed "
"off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7212"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "7224"
msgid "Have you even been listening to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7236"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7248"
msgid "What a jerk."
msgstr "Che idiota."

msgctxt "7260"
msgid "<Italic>Such</Italic> a jackass, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7272"
msgid ""
"Like sure, maybe I make some guys mad. It's not like I don't hear that a "
"lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7284"
msgid ""
"I'm all about looking out for number one, so that's no big deal for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7296"
msgid ""
"But for him, I actually try to be considerate! Like, I go out of my way to "
"make him happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7308"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7320"
msgid "Who the hell says that to his own girlfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7332"
msgid "He went too far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7344"
msgid "...I'm glad you understand me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7356"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7368"
msgid "I know how he feels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7380"
msgid "You what? What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7392"
msgid ""
"He shouldn't have phrased it like that, but I can tell he said it out of "
"love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7416"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "7428"
msgid "I hope you're right about him. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7440"
msgid "I know I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7452"
msgid "Heheheh. Now you've even got me believing it. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7464"
msgid "'Cause it's easy to believe what I want to hear! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7476"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "7488"
msgid "*sigh* Listen, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7500"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "7512"
msgid ""
"Remember I told you about my friend? Her boyfriend found out she's a "
"hostess, and now their relationship's in trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7524"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "7536"
msgid "I guess I'm in her shoes now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7548"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "7560"
msgid "How'd he find out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7572"
msgid "I know he isn't into cabaret clubs, so I figured I was safe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7584"
msgid "...Did he look through your phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7596"
msgid "No! I don't work that much, and I delete all my texts to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7608"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "7620"
msgid "But now I think he's seriously going to dump me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7632"
msgid ""
"What should I do? What <Italic>can</Italic> I do? Do you have any ideas?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7644"
msgid "Why don't you explain your reasons to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7656"
msgid "Reasons? What, to kill time and make spending money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7668"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "7680"
msgid "Do you think he'd understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7692"
msgid "Wouldn't he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7704"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7716"
msgid "Nope, I don't think it'd work! He doesn't like those kinds of talks..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7728"
msgid "Man, what am I supposed to do now? I'm so screwed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7740"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7752"
msgid "You could start by apologizing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7764"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7776"
msgid ""
"But... should I really be apologizing to him? It's not like I did anything "
"wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7788"
msgid "Well, there are different ways to apologize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7800"
msgid "Huh!? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "7812"
msgid "You could apologize for hurting him, even accidentally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7824"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "7836"
msgid "It might be awkward, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7848"
msgid "I feel like he'd just cut me off and say I should have known better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7860"
msgid "Man, what am I supposed to do now? I'm so screwed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7872"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7884"
msgid "You could apologize for hiding it from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7896"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7908"
msgid "...Yeah. That's probably the safest thing to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7920"
msgid "But how do I even start? Tell him I didn't want him to worry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7932"
msgid "Yeah. That's the truth, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7944"
msgid "Actually, it was more like... 'cause I knew he'd annoy me about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7956"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "7968"
msgid "Are we going to be okay? I'm so screwed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7980"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7992"
msgid "Just give up on him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8004"
msgid "What!? That's not an option..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8016"
msgid "Who are you to decide that, anyway? You're really mean, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8028"
msgid "I thought we'd get married someday..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8040"
msgid "Oh. Sorry."
msgstr "Oh. Scusa."

msgctxt "8052"
msgid "Man, what am I supposed to do now? I'm so screwed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8064"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8076"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*sospiro*"

msgctxt "8088"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "8100"
msgid ""
"I just remembered one of my earlier customers, and got all annoyed again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8112"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8124"
msgid "He visits once in a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8136"
msgid ""
"Didn't we talk about him before, Kiryu-san? You asked if he even enjoyed "
"going to cabaret clubs. Remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8148"
msgid ""
"He was saying stuff like, \"Meeting you has been the most fun I've ever "
"had.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8160"
msgid "I thought he was so creepy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8172"
msgid "But I couldn't just brush him off, so I just kinda smiled and nodded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8184"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "8196"
msgid "But then, he asked if I was happy to see him, acting all expectant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8208"
msgid ""
"He was really getting on my nerves, so I just spoke my mind, and he stormed "
"out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8220"
msgid "What'd you tell him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8232"
msgid "\"Sure, whatever.\" That's all I said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8244"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "8256"
msgid "What? Was that bad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8268"
msgid "I wouldn't go that far, but..."
msgstr "Non direi, ma..."

msgctxt "8280"
msgid "Then what?"
msgstr "E poi?"

msgctxt "8292"
msgid "It was probably the way you said it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304"
msgid "How should I have said it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8316"
msgid "It'd be better if you figured that out yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8328"
msgid "Aw, what!? Come on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8340"
msgid "But, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8352"
msgid ""
"I can't tell you something I've never thought of. And it's so annoying when "
"people get all preachy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8376"
msgid "Try playing nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8388"
msgid "Aw, what!? I'm not doing that for some old geezer! ♪ Heheheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8400"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8412"
msgid ""
"When I with you, I don't need to pretend to be nice. That's why this is fun."
" <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8424"
msgid "I don't know how I feel about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8436"
msgid "Let's drown your sorrows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8448"
msgid ""
"I don't really feel like drinking... After all, it was just a moment of "
"anger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8460"
msgid "So you're fine, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8472"
msgid "I mean, if that guy shows up again, it's all gonna come rushing back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8484"
msgid "I doubt he'll be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8496"
msgid ""
"Life has been a real drag lately. It doesn't really feel like I'm about to "
"hit the work force..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8508"
msgid "Though college is pretty boring. So work won't be that bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8520"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "8532"
msgid "I mean it. College is so boring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8544"
msgid "I'm not interested in anything, and I can't get into the rhythm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8556"
msgid ""
"So many students just run around yelling all day, and they go on mixers "
"year-round. They're so immature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8580"
msgid ""
"I can't focus, I can't get excited about my studies... I just sit around "
"whining."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8592"
msgid "I don't even know why I'm doing this. Eheheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8604"
msgid "You're just getting started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8616"
msgid "I am?"
msgstr "Lo sono?"

msgctxt "8628"
msgid "Just try and enjoy your job from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8640"
msgid "Hmm... I wonder if I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8652"
msgid "It's up to you, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8664"
msgid "Okay, then. I'll try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8676"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "8688"
msgid "That's life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8700"
msgid "Is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8712"
msgid ""
"When you don't work towards something, everything you do feels like a drag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8724"
msgid "Ohhh... I totally get that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8736"
msgid "But still, work is so boooooring!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8748"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8760"
msgid "Whatever, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8772"
msgid "It's all in the past now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8784"
msgid "Hehehe! ♪ Exactly! It's just whatever! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8796"
msgid "Why did I even want to go to college...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8808"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8820"
msgid "Hey, what'd you have for breakfast this morning?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8832"
msgid "Breakfast?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8844"
msgid ""
"Me, I had a croissant. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I bought it yesterday. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8856"
msgid "Then, I had another croissant for lunch. ♪ A chocolate one. Hehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8868"
msgid "You love croissants that much, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8880"
msgid ""
"I have to be in the mood for them, but I guess I was craving them today. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8892"
msgid "So when I needed a snack, I went for a maple croissant. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8904"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I had a cinnamon croissant just earlier. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8916"
msgid "How many damn croissants do you eat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8928"
msgid "I mean, it's just a croissanty kind of day. I can't help myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8940"
msgid "Do you have... other, non-croissanty kinds of days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8952"
msgid "Hmm... Some days, I'm all about shochu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8964"
msgid "In other words, those are \"drunk\" days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8976"
msgid "You need a lifetime supply of croissants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8988"
msgid "Ahahaha! I couldn't handle that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9000"
msgid "Still, you never know, right? Maybe I could give that a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9012"
msgid "I doubt that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9024"
msgid "Oh. Okay, then."
msgstr "Oh... Okay allora."

msgctxt "9036"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9048"
msgid "You want another one, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9060"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "9072"
msgid "You gonna close out the day with cinnamon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9084"
msgid "Huh!? How'd you figure it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9096"
msgid "Pretty sharp, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9108"
msgid "After this, I think I'll have... a raisin croissant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9120"
msgid "And you're not sick of them...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9132"
msgid ""
"Sure, maybe you'd get sick of them, Kiryu-san. That's 'cause you're not me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9144"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9156"
msgid "Kiryu-san, what do you do when you're in a bad mood?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9168"
msgid "Do you bottle it up? Or take it out on someone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9180"
msgid "Where's this coming from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9192"
msgid "I dunno, I was just wondering..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9204"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9216"
msgid ""
"Actually, it's really important to know how to make yourself feel better, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9228"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "9240"
msgid "It can be annoying when you can't calm down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9252"
msgid ""
"...Well, it doesn't take much for me. I perk up whenever anyone gives me "
"food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9264"
msgid "Do you want anything right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9276"
msgid "Um, what? I didn't say I was feeling down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9288"
msgid "Do I really seem that impressionable to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9300"
msgid "No, I was just wondering if you were hungry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9312"
msgid "I just said, I'm not in a bad mood. Didn't you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9324"
msgid "...You sure about that?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro di quello?"

msgctxt "9336"
msgid "You're like an animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9348"
msgid "Ahahaha! I'm totally a stray cat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9360"
msgid ""
"Seriously, wouldn't anyone cheer up if you put something tasty in front of "
"them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9372"
msgid "Yeah, I guess."
msgstr "Sì, immagino."

msgctxt "9384"
msgid "I dunno. I think I've just got a weakness for food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9396"
msgid "You taking notes, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9408"
msgid "Uh, sure..."
msgstr "Uh, certo..."

msgctxt "9420"
msgid "That must make life simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9432"
msgid "I know, right? Yup, that's what it's like to be me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9444"
msgid ""
"No matter how bad of a mood you're in, wouldn't you cheer up if someone put "
"something tasty in front of you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9456"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr "Forse..."

msgctxt "9468"
msgid "Do people ever say you're selfish, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9480"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "9492"
msgid "Really..."
msgstr "Davvero...?"

msgctxt "9504"
msgid "I have a friend who called me all \"self-centered\" and stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9516"
msgid ""
"But that's not it. It's just my rule to do what makes me happy. I don't "
"think that makes me self-centered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9528"
msgid "So I just told her... it's whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9540"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9552"
msgid "Is that weird?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9564"
msgid "It's weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9576"
msgid "Aw, you think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9588"
msgid "This rule sounds exactly like self-centeredness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9600"
msgid "It's totally different!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9612"
msgid "You could've fooled me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9624"
msgid "It's not weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9636"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr "Vero?"

msgctxt "9648"
msgid ""
"But it still happens! People call me selfish or shallow all the time. It's "
"so annoying, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9660"
msgid "I wouldn't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9672"
msgid "You're a woman who knows what she wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9684"
msgid "When people say stuff like that, it just pisses me off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9696"
msgid "But they're right, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9708"
msgid "Sure, I guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9720"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9732"
msgid "It's whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9744"
msgid "Huh? Wait, what?"
msgstr "Eh? Aspetta, cooosa?"

msgctxt "9756"
msgid "Just borrowing from the master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9768"
msgid ""
"Hehehehe! ♪ What the heck, Kiryu-san? Anyone ever tell you you're a jerk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9780"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "9792"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9804"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "9816"
msgid "...Um."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9828"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9840"
msgid "What, you worried?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9852"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "9864"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "9876"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "9888"
msgid "He dumped me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9900"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "9912"
msgid "My boyfriend walked out on me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9924"
msgid "...Oh. That's rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9936"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9948"
msgid "...You've been crying, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9960"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "9972"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "9984"
msgid "Well... forget about him. You'll find a better guy before you know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9996"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10008"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "10020"
msgid "Did you apologize properly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10032"
msgid "...Yeah. But it didn't work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10044"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "10056"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10068"
msgid "...Kiryu-san, is it okay if I cry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10080"
msgid "...Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10092"
msgid "Hey, cheer up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10104"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10116"
msgid "Eheheh... I don't think I can..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10128"
msgid "Hm... Well, can't blame you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10140"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10152"
msgid "...Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10164"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "10176"
msgid "Is it okay if I cry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10188"
msgid "...Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10200"
msgid "Heheheh. I'm okay now. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10212"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "10224"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10236"
msgid "...Hey, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "Ehi, Kiryu-san?"

msgctxt "10248"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "10260"
msgid "Thanks. Really. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10272"
msgid "Heh. Don't mention it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10284"
msgid "After my boyfriend dumped me, I was in a really bad place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10296"
msgid ""
"But then I got to talk to you. And somehow, that really helped me calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10308"
msgid "Then it's a good thing overall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10320"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "10332"
msgid "You think this was good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10344"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "10356"
msgid "...I just broke up. I don't think that's something to be happy about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10368"
msgid "Oh. Well, right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10380"
msgid "Ugh, and now it's back in my head..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10404"
msgid "Take it easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10416"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10428"
msgid "Just sit around and be lazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10440"
msgid "Teehee. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> What the heck, man? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10452"
msgid "I'd do that whether you told me to or not. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10464"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "10476"
msgid "Don't fall for me, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10488"
msgid "Pfft! What the heck, man!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10500"
msgid "Isn't it a little early for that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10512"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10524"
msgid "Don't you \"hah\" me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10536"
msgid "Now you're sounding like yourself again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10548"
msgid "Oh, you! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10560"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "10572"
msgid "*sigh* Listen, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10584"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "10596"
msgid "Seriously, I don't know why he's mad. My manager blew up at me, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10608"
msgid "Again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10620"
msgid ""
"Okay, so... A customer had been drinking too much, so I watered down his "
"brandy for his health, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10632"
msgid "But when I did that, he got mad at me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10644"
msgid ""
"That kinda ticked me off, but I figured he's an adult who can make his own "
"choices. So I made his next drink stronger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10656"
msgid "But he just got mad at me again! This time it was too strong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10680"
msgid ""
"My manager's advice didn't even make sense. He said not to make him mad "
"'cause he's fat? What do I even do with that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10692"
msgid ""
"Ugh! Still, once I remembered you might visit today, I felt a little better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10704"
msgid "If you couldn't tell, I'm actually trying to do my job today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10716"
msgid "Sounds crazy, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10728"
msgid "You're not used to actually trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10740"
msgid "Whaaaat!? You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10752"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "10764"
msgid "Well, it sounds reasonable. You might be right. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10776"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "10788"
msgid "Honestly, maybe I'm not cut out for this job, huh? Hehehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10800"
msgid ""
"But I feel like you really get me, Kiryu-san. It makes me so\r\n"
"happy. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10812"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "10824"
msgid "Sounds like you've got it rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10836"
msgid "Right!? It's crazy here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10848"
msgid "Well, don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10860"
msgid "I'm not worried, but now I'm feeling kinda down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10872"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10884"
msgid "Cheer up and have a drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10896"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10908"
msgid "I'm not really in the mood..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10920"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10932"
msgid ""
"I'm not usually the type to get hung up on this stuff, but it still ruined "
"my whole day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10944"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10956"
msgid "I went to the batting center with my friend today. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10968"
msgid "Hit any home runs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10980"
msgid ""
"Man, I couldn't hit a single ball! But it was still fun. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10992"
msgid ""
"Oh, and get this! There was this really intense-looking guy like you in the "
"booth next to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11004"
msgid ""
"He couldn't hit at all either. I was like, come on, man! At least hit one! "
"Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11016"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "11028"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I get this weird feeling you're like that guy. Like maybe you "
"suck at batting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11040"
msgid ""
"But at the same time, you've got this aura to you that makes me wonder if "
"you're actually a batting pro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11052"
msgid "So, can you bat or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11064"
msgid "Of course I can."
msgstr "Certo che può."

msgctxt "11076"
msgid "See, I knew it! My prediction was right on! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11088"
msgid ""
"Hey, we should drop by the batting center together sometime. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11100"
msgid "Sure, that sounds fun."
msgstr "Certo. Sembra divertente."

msgctxt "11112"
msgid "Nope, not at all."
msgstr "No. Per niente."

msgctxt "11124"
msgid "What!? You can't bat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11136"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "11148"
msgid "Whaaaat!? So my intuition was off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11160"
msgid "Well, we won't know until I try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11172"
msgid ""
"Hey, we should drop by the batting center together sometime. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11184"
msgid "Sure, that sounds fun."
msgstr "Certo. Sembra divertente."

msgctxt "11196"
msgid "I went to nationals in high school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11208"
msgid "What!? No way! For real?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11220"
msgid "Just messing with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11232"
msgid "Pfft! What the heck, man! It was a serious question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11244"
msgid ""
"Hey, we should drop by the batting center together sometime. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11256"
msgid "Sure, that sounds fun."
msgstr "Certo. Sembra divertente."

msgctxt "11280"
msgid "Earlier, I visited this fortune teller in Kamurocho for a reading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11292"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "11304"
msgid "What? Kiryu-san, don't tell me you're not interested!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11316"
msgid ""
"She's gotten a lot of attention recently for her readings being so accurate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11328"
msgid "Really."
msgstr "Davvero."

msgctxt "11340"
msgid "But her fortune didn't come true for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11352"
msgid ""
"I was telling her how she was wrong, and she just started lecturing me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11364"
msgid ""
"She was giving me all this crap, telling me I'm being rude and hurtful, that"
" my \"whatever\" attitude pushes people away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11376"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11388"
msgid "Hearing her go on and on just made me mad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400"
msgid "So was she right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11412"
msgid "Huh!? Whaddaya mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire!?"

msgctxt "11424"
msgid "Are you dwelling on it because she was right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11436"
msgid "...Of course not. I just meant it'll work itself out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11448"
msgid "It probably will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11460"
msgid "I knew you'd understand, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11472"
msgid "...It sure took me a while, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11484"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti."

msgctxt "11496"
msgid ""
"It doesn't bother me but isn't it just, like, frustrating? To have someone "
"just come out and say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11508"
msgid "It's not like I try to hurt anyone's feelings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11520"
msgid "...Well, it's easy to misunderstand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11532"
msgid "You actually agree with her, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11544"
msgid "I wouldn't go that far."
msgstr "Non arriverei a tanto..."

msgctxt "11556"
msgid "...Fine, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11580"
msgid "I'd feel pushed away, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11592"
msgid "Huh!? You too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11604"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it by now, but if your go-to response is \"whatever,\" it comes "
"off as pretty rude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11616"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11628"
msgid "Maybe you should think more about what you say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11640"
msgid "...It's just the way I talk, though. I'm not gonna change how I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11652"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11676"
msgid "Oh! I've totally seen a dwarf!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11688"
msgid "Uh, where did that come from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11700"
msgid "When I was little, I saw a real live dwarf! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11712"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11724"
msgid ""
"I was just talking about this! My friend and I were talking about "
"supernatural stuff, whether spirits are real..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11736"
msgid ""
"I was saying I don't believe in that stuff, 'cause it's just like, "
"whatever..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11748"
msgid "But now, I just remembered!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11760"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "11772"
msgid "The point is, I know I've seen a real-live dwarf! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11784"
msgid "When I was little, we used to play with fireworks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11796"
msgid ""
"And one time, this little gnome thing ran up to me and tried to steal my "
"fireworks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11808"
msgid "I yelled, and tried to scare him off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11820"
msgid ""
"It still kept trying to steal them from me! But I didn't let it steal a "
"single one! Hehehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11832"
msgid "What happened after that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "Hm? Dunno."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11856"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "11868"
msgid "I don't remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11880"
msgid "You've got quite an imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11892"
msgid "No, no, I swear it's all true! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11916"
msgid "You seriously don't believe me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11928"
msgid "Hey, I didn't say a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11940"
msgid "Why would I make it up? There's no point in lying, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11952"
msgid "Oh right, I should tell my friend tomorrow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11964"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11976"
msgid "Was it just a dream?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11988"
msgid "Whaaaaat!? It wasn't a dream..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12000"
msgid "Did anyone else see it happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12012"
msgid "I don't know. I don't think so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12024"
msgid "...but I remember it. I'd never forget those fireworks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12036"
msgid "It was back in Karuizawa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12048"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "12060"
msgid "Is this a setup for a joke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12072"
msgid "Ahahaha. I swear, no joke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12084"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12096"
msgid "Actually, I'm glad I remembered. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12108"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12120"
msgid "...Though, now that I think about it, that's pretty scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12132"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "12144"
msgid ""
"Do you go out a lot, Kiryu-san? Or would you say you're more of a homebody? "
"How would you describe yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12156"
msgid "That's a good question."
msgstr "Bella domanda!"

msgctxt "12168"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "12180"
msgid ""
"I know I'd never leave the house if I didn't have to. But that makes me "
"sound like a hermit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12192"
msgid "You, a hermit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12204"
msgid "Well, I mean, if I never leave my house..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12216"
msgid "I don't see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12228"
msgid ""
"I always stay in the clothes I woke up in, and I don't even put on makeup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12240"
msgid "But isn't it nice to crash whenever you get tired?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12252"
msgid ""
"At the very least, it's better than obligations forcing you to go be social,"
" y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12264"
msgid "I'm not too social either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12276"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I figured. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I can't take getting stuck in "
"crowds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12288"
msgid ""
"Speaking of, this club gets packed super tight some days. Honestly, it gets "
"really annoying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12300"
msgid "I wish you were my only customer, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12312"
msgid "You realize you could get fired for saying that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12324"
msgid "I usually like being outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12336"
msgid "Oh, I see..."
msgstr "Ah, capisco..."

msgctxt "12348"
msgid "You really can't stand staying at home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12360"
msgid "I'd rather go out than stay in, is all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12372"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "12384"
msgid "I guess we're just two different people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12396"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12408"
msgid "Why don't you spend more time outside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12420"
msgid "Heheheh. What's the point when I could relax at home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12432"
msgid "Well, fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12444"
msgid ""
"Want to come hang out at home with me? You might find it hard to give up "
"once you try..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12456"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "12468"
msgid "Teehee! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Wow, are you blushing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12480"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12492"
msgid "Ahh, I just wanna go home already..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12504"
msgid "Something happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12516"
msgid ""
"Nah. I bought some cloth for a new nightgown today. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I wanna get home and start working on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12528"
msgid "\"Working on it\"? You're making one yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12540"
msgid "Yup. A homemade nightgown. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12552"
msgid ""
"I make them myself, since the store-bought ones aren't cute enough for me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12564"
msgid "That's impressive."
msgstr "Impressionante."

msgctxt "12576"
msgid "I'm pretty handy around the house. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12588"
msgid "You're a real homemaker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12600"
msgid "I dunno about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12612"
msgid ""
"It's more like I never go outside, so I like hobbies that let me stay home "
"and drink all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12624"
msgid "Well, fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12636"
msgid "Is any of that actually true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12648"
msgid "What!? I'm being serious here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12660"
msgid "You don't strike me as a homemaker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12672"
msgid "Hey, cut me some slack! ♪ I can do housework and stuff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12684"
msgid "One look at my bedroom would prove it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12696"
msgid "Maybe next time, you can come take a look..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12708"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "Ma che?"

msgctxt "12720"
msgid "Teehee! <Color:7> ⑮<Color:Default> Now that one was a joke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12744"
msgid "You'll make a good wife someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12756"
msgid ""
"You really mean it? Wow, I'm glad to hear that! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12768"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12780"
msgid "So, maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12792"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "12804"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you could be my⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12816"
msgid "...Nah. Never mind! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12828"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "12840"
msgid ""
"I took the train for the first time in a while today, and I had a nice "
"little moment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12852"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "12864"
msgid "My seat was at the end of the train, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12876"
msgid "But then, this really old couple got on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12888"
msgid ""
"So like, the old man sat down next to me, and his wife was stuck standing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12900"
msgid ""
"I was like, \"What the hell!? Give the lady a seat, gramps!\" But then I "
"noticed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12912"
msgid "It turns out I got totally the wrong idea. The old man had bad legs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12924"
msgid ""
"But I realized I could give her my own seat! So I offered, but she told me "
"they weren't going far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12936"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12948"
msgid "The old lady thanked me. She was so sweet, saying stuff like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12960"
msgid "\"Such a pretty girl...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12972"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! ♪ I started getting to know them. The three of us had a great "
"conversation! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12984"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "12996"
msgid "That old man was so hilarious, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13008"
msgid ""
"He was telling me how beautiful I looked! Like a younger version of his "
"wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13020"
msgid ""
"Then, he bragged that even if she's wrinkly now, her skin used to be even "
"smoother than mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13032"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13044"
msgid ""
"When we got to their stop, they were supporting each other as they got off "
"the train..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13056"
msgid "Isn't that so nice? It gave me the warm fuzzies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13068"
msgid "That was a great story."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13080"
msgid "Right? ♪ It's weirdly comforting. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13092"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "13104"
msgid ""
"I hope I can find someone who'll be with me forever. We can be just like "
"them.  <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13116"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "13128"
msgid "What a damn fine woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13140"
msgid "I know what you mean. She seemed really nice, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13152"
msgid "No... I was talking about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13164"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "13176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13188"
msgid "Are you seriously hitting on me right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13200"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "13212"
msgid "They sound like a great couple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13224"
msgid "Yeah! ♪ They were awesome. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13236"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "13248"
msgid "...Makes you think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13260"
msgid ""
"If those two ended up so close, they must have been through a lot together, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13272"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13284"
msgid "And after all that, they're still together. Holding each other up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13296"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "13308"
msgid "I've been so tired lately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13320"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "13332"
msgid "It's fine... Maybe I've been working too hard? Eheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13344"
msgid "I only get six hours on duty per day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13356"
msgid "At the club, you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13368"
msgid "Yeah. Can't work any longer than that. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13380"
msgid ""
"I wish I could spend the other 18 hours of the day sleeping. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13392"
msgid "Just how much do you sleep?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13404"
msgid "I can't help it if I love relaxing! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13416"
msgid "That still sounds kind of unhealthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13428"
msgid "Aww! But I'm fine! ♪ What's the big deal? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13452"
msgid "That sounds rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13464"
msgid "Not at all! ♪ It totally works for me. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13476"
msgid "You sleep 18 hours every night?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13488"
msgid ""
"I don't sleep the whole time. More than half of that is just sitting around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13512"
msgid "How old are you, again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13524"
msgid "Hehehe! ♪ I'm 22."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13536"
msgid "If you're still young, shouldn't you be more physically active?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13548"
msgid "But I just wanna sit around!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13560"
msgid "Even while I'm kicking back, I can still get some exercise, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13572"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13596"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you don't pay much attention to your body, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13608"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "Non proprio."

msgctxt "13620"
msgid "Do you watch what you eat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13632"
msgid "...Nope."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13644"
msgid "I knew it..."
msgstr "Lo sapevo."

msgctxt "13656"
msgid "It's super unhealthy to live like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13668"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "13680"
msgid "Once, I had acute gastroenteritis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13692"
msgid ""
"I came down with a really bad fever, and my stomach hurt so bad I puked "
"blood. That made me realize how bad it could get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13704"
msgid "Ever since then, I've been careful about what I eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13716"
msgid "Sounds like you had it rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13728"
msgid "Wait, don't you get what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13740"
msgid "The point is that I'm worried about you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13752"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13764"
msgid "Haven't you ever gotten really sick before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13776"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "Non lo so..."

msgctxt "13788"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that figures..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13800"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13812"
msgid "You must've eaten something bad, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13824"
msgid ""
"I don't remember what I ate, but the pain was so bad I thought I was going "
"to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13836"
msgid "Yikes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13848"
msgid ""
"That's my point! You should really pay more attention to what you put in "
"your mouth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13860"
msgid "...Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13872"
msgid "Huh? Thanks for what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13884"
msgid "You were worried about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13896"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr "Credo di sì..."

msgctxt "13908"
msgid "I mean... Kiryu-san, if you got sick..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13920"
msgid ""
"Then who would I vent to? I have to release my stress somehow! Hehehehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13932"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Ehi."

msgctxt "13944"
msgid "I'll be fine."
msgstr "Me la caverò."

msgctxt "13956"
msgid "What? How?"
msgstr "Cosa? In che senso?"

msgctxt "13968"
msgid "My body's pretty sturdy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13980"
msgid ""
"So what? It won't be sturdy forever. And you never know when you'll get "
"sick..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13992"
msgid ""
"And if that happens, say goodbye to all your favorite foods. Sounds "
"terrible, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14004"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "14016"
msgid "And if you drink too much, you'll destroy your liver."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14028"
msgid "True..."
msgstr "Vero..."

msgctxt "14040"
msgid "Ugh... I'm so annoyed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14052"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "14064"
msgid "Just an annoying old guy earlier. Pretty stupid, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14076"
msgid "\"Why don't you sign a monthly contract with me?\" Uh, hell no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14088"
msgid ""
"I tried to turn him down all professional, but he wouldn't shut up, so I had"
" to lie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14100"
msgid "I told him I have a boyfriend..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14112"
